   </title>
   <indicator ascending="1" measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project integrates climate risks in programming</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The integration of climate risks in programming includes an undertaking of concrete actions to reduce and/or mitigate risks related to climate change impact and disaster risks  ( for example droughts, erosion, salinization, flooding, etc.) 
